    sd:notes "Confirmed by direct viewing: a real, already-populated 'View Batch Job Status' screen (Run Date/Batch Job filters, paginated results) listing 8+ real job names — Process CEPAS posting file (Daily), Delete TPI Endorsement (Daily), Calculate Dashboard data (Daily), Process Credential data (Daily), a PPR-Hold soft-delete job, Send reminder email for expiring certificates (Daily), Process Pending Evaluation Applications to UnAssigned (Daily), Delete Certificate Applications (Daily) x3 — with Run Status/Start/End timestamps and a Run Status Description. Strong, concrete evidence this console already exists as production/legacy functionality — see Annotation_BatchJobAdminVisibilityEvidence below. None of these job names literally match cred:BatchJob_DefinitionVersionActivation or cred:BatchJob_CredentialExpirationProcessing by name; 'Process Credential data' and 'Delete Certificate Applications' are the closest conceptual overlaps." ;
